WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
[Original instrumental synth music]
A little code. A world of possibilities. A Debian-based operating system for creating with BASIC.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Start with a few lines. Write a program. Run it. See what you made.

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Make something move. Real ModernBASIC graphics and interactive color demos.

4
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Make room for music. The original soundtrack was exported by the BASIC synth.

5
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Linux, one key away. F12 opens Bash administration in ModernBASIC OS.

6
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Your next idea starts at READY. Explore the manual. Try a first program. Make it yours.

